    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17361" root="زبد" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُبَادٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُرَابٌ</span> [in measure], <i>Fresh butter</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُبْد</span>) <i>that has become bad,</i> or <i>spoiled, in the
churning:</i> or, as some say, <i>thin milk.</i> (TA voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِخْتَلَطَ</span>, q. v.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُبَّادُ اللَّبَن</span>, below.]

